  "final_message": "`shipping.ZONES` in `shipping.py` has 5 distinct keys: `NA-EAST`, `NA-WEST`, `EU-CENTRAL`, `EU-NORTH` and `APAC-SE`.\n\nI didn't count anything from the other files, since the README names `shipping.py` as the source of truth:\n- **`decoy_legacy_zones.py`:** an old, deprecated zone table (`ZONE-A` to `ZONE-D`).\n- **`decoy_partner_regions.py`:** a partner carrier's regions, which aren't zone codes.\n- **`decoy_warehouse_map.py`:** maps warehouses to zone codes that already appear in `shipping.ZONES`, so it adds nothing new.\n- **`checkout.py`, `notify.py` and `.amplifier/settings.local.yaml`:** contain no zone definitions.\n\nANSWER: 5",
